Hi all,

I have custom array (similar to human Exon array) and try to study alternative splicing using FIRMA.
i) in theory, I think I can use FIRMA, but wonder that's possible at current aroma.affymetrix setup.
ii) if that's possible, what should be a chipType (i.e. can I use any human exon array such as chipType <- "HuEx-1_0-st-v2" )
iii) is there anything else I need to consider in terms of algorithm implementation since this is a custom array?

Thank you so much!
Hannah

