These are the two possible ways to setup the CEL data set:

cs <- AffymetrixCelSet$byName("LeeAV_2012", chipType="GenomeWideSNP_6,Full")

and

cdf <- AffymetrixCdfFile$byChipType("GenomeWideSNP_6", tags="Full");
cs <- AffymetrixCelSet$byName("LeeAV_2012", cdf=cdf);

and it appears from you file listing that that should be the case for
you.  If you get both to work, you've ready to move on.

/Henrik

